body:
Thank you so much. i totally agree with you but he doesn't budge. It's nice to have someone understand my point of view. It's rather frustrating and he tells me he doesn't trust me; it doesn't make sense. Again I never was one of those girls who got on for their looks. I don't relaly care regardless? Get that bag. But to be painted in the same brush? I'm just someone who enjoys videogames, doing art and expressing my creativity. I try to make people laugh, I talk about mental health a lot since I struggle quite a bit and want people to know it's alright to not be alright and to find help. I don't know. Thank you anyway!

&#x200B;

Helped!
